{"name":"Archivist","hex":"#9f8c73","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"archivist","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["One who is in charge of, or performs the task of creating, collecting, cataloguing and organising archives."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/archivist"}],"entries":[{"title":"Archivist","blocks":[{"text":"An archivist is an information professional who assesses, collects, organizes, preserves, maintains control over, and provides access to records and archives determined to have long-term value. The records that are maintained by an archivist can consist of a variety of forms, including but not limited to letters, diaries, logs, other personal documents, government documents, sound or picture recordings, digital files, or other physical objects."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/38/Archivist_Survey.jpg/330px-Archivist_Survey.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Archivist","wikidata":"Q635734"},{"title":"Archivist (band)","blocks":[{"text":"Archivist are a European post-metal band formed in 2014. The band comprises four Austrian instrumentalists, English vocalist and artist Alex CF, and German vocalist Anna. They have produced a trilogy of concept albums—Archivist (2015), Construct (2017), and Triumvirate (2019)—which follows an epic science fiction narrative created by Alex. The eponymous Archivist is \"the unwitting survivor of a massive ecological disaster. The last human alive, yet in relative safety aboard the only remaining ark jettisoned from a dying Earth, she begins to record her memories of the world left in turmoil by humanity's shortsightedness and greed.\" She shares the spaceship with an artificial intelligence, Construct. Together they are the sole survivors of total destruction between humans and machines."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Archivist_(band)","wikidata":"Q65079175"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1c/Archivist_at_Kibbutz_Lochamei_Hagetaot.jpg/500px-Archivist_at_Kibbutz_Lochamei_Hagetaot.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1c/Archivist_at_Kibbutz_Lochamei_Hagetaot.jpg/1280px-Archivist_at_Kibbutz_Lochamei_Hagetaot.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1c/Archivist_at_Kibbutz_Lochamei_Hagetaot.jpg/500px-Archivist_at_Kibbutz_Lochamei_Hagetaot.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"An archivist retrieving files from mobile shelving","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AArchivist_at_Kibbutz_Lochamei_Hagetaot.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/aa/Conservation_Lab_-_DPLA_-_a20359c1c1005c8e5e9b7e15cd1f58c2.jpg/500px-Conservation_Lab_-_DPLA_-_a20359c1c1005c8e5e9b7e15cd1f58c2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/aa/Conservation_Lab_-_DPLA_-_a20359c1c1005c8e5e9b7e15cd1f58c2.jpg/500px-Conservation_Lab_-_DPLA_-_a20359c1c1005c8e5e9b7e15cd1f58c2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Inside a conservation lab, items are being prepared.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AConservation_Lab_-_DPLA_-_a20359c1c1005c8e5e9b7e15cd1f58c2.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/01/2001-A_Space_Odyssey_Space_Station_%289457837561%29.jpg/500px-2001-A_Space_Odyssey_Space_Station_%289457837561%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/01/2001-A_Space_Odyssey_Space_Station_%289457837561%29.jpg/1280px-2001-A_Space_Odyssey_Space_Station_%289457837561%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/01/2001-A_Space_Odyssey_Space_Station_%289457837561%29.jpg/500px-2001-A_Space_Odyssey_Space_Station_%289457837561%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Stanley Kubrick's 1968 epic science fiction film 2001: A Space Odyssey influenced the band's artistry.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3A2001-A_Space_Odyssey_Space_Station_(9457837561).jpg"}],"sounds":{"archivist":[{"type":"audio/wav","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b8/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-archivist.wav?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/b8/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-archivist.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-archivist.wav.mp3"},{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/b8/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-archivist.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-archivist.wav.ogg"}]},"pictures":[{"title":"Eastern grey kangaroo (Macropus giganteus) Mount Annan composite of 6","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/46/Eastern_grey_kangaroo_%28Macropus_giganteus%29_Mount_Annan_composite_of_6.jpg/500px-Eastern_grey_kangaroo_%28Macropus_giganteus%29_Mount_Annan_composite_of_6.jpg","ratio":4.413151003782368,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Eastern_grey_kangaroo_(Macropus_giganteus)_Mount_Annan_composite_of_6.jpg","share":0.44125},{"title":"Grey Carpet from above","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3c/Grey_Carpet_from_above.jpg/500px-Grey_Carpet_from_above.jpg","ratio":1.3333333333333333,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Grey_Carpet_from_above.jpg","share":0.314375},{"title":"Grey-breasted mountain toucan (Andigena hypoglauca) Caldas","image":"https://thumb.wikime